  'vws-open-day-newlands-fire-base-28-november-2026-11-15',
  'Volunteer Wildfire Services opens its Newlands base to the public on 28 November',
  'Community', '2026-11-15', 'Cape Town ETC', 'https://www.capetownetc.com/news/vws-open-day-returns-to-cape-town-with-exciting-activities-for-all-ages/',
  'Volunteer Wildfire Services holds its annual fundraising open day at the Newlands Fire Base on Saturday 28 November, from 09:00 to 16:00.',
  'Volunteer Wildfire Services (VWS), the non-profit that fights wildfires across the Western Cape, is inviting the public to its annual open day on Saturday 28 November. The day runs from 09:00 to 16:00 at the Newlands Fire Base, on Union Avenue in Newlands, and doubles as a fundraiser for the organisation.

Visitors can expect live firefighting demonstrations, which include a helicopter water drop, as well as a display by service dogs. There are rides in firefighting vehicles, a chance to handle a fire hose, abseiling and an obstacle course for children. Exhibitors cover fynbos, local wildlife and habitat protection, and there is a bubble and water party for younger visitors. Food and drink stalls and VWS merchandise are on offer, and a group of newly qualified volunteer firefighters will be introduced on the day.

Children enter free but must be pre-registered, and a Quicket ticket is needed to take part in activities. Adults pay an entrance fee and are asked to book online through Quicket under the name VWS Open Day 2026. Parking is available at the University of Cape Town, with a shuttle running to the entrance of the event, according to Cape Town ETC. VWS says money raised supports its firefighting work in the coming fire season, and it asks followers to watch its social channels for updates.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.capetownetc.com/news/vws-open-day-returns-to-cape-town-with-exciting-activities-for-all-ages/", "https://happeningnext.com/event/vws-open-day-2026-eid3a0e96wm3w"]',
  'agent'
);
